{"des":"浴缸之魂-接取步骤","script":"s_5_8_0","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这个嘛……情况有些复杂。我正在为这位远道而来的客人进行治疗。[l][cm]","charaName":"药化系学生赫尔薇"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_2"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0.4,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]远道而来的客人……咦？这不是巴诺姆村的瑟尼吗？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]咳咳……好冷好冷……[l][cm]","charaName":"“浴缸”瑟尼"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]是这样的，不久前我在大书院的野外采集药草时，突然发现这位朋友倒在冰雪中。我将他带回进行治疗，诊断他可能是因低温而陷入昏迷，目前算是脱离了生命危险，正在恢复中。[l][cm]","charaName":"药化系学生赫尔薇"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1b","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1b","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]你也是黑森林来的吧。能在这里遇到老乡真开心。[l][cm]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_7"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1b","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我也一样。祝福你，森林的友人。[l][cm]","charaName":"药化系学生赫尔薇"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_8"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]说起来……你们好像认识这个人啊，你们所说的巴诺姆村……又是在什么地方啊？[l]","charaName":"药化系学生赫尔薇"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_9"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_10","text":"就是索利德山上的一个村庄。"},{"tag":"tag_10","text":"瑟尼就是来自那边的村民。"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_10"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]索利德山啊……原来如此。从那种炎热的地方来到冰原，身体一时无法适应也是正常。况且他身上的保暖魔法已经消散，单凭血肉之躯确实难以抵御这般严寒。[l][cm]","charaName":"药化系学生赫尔薇"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_11"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]呜……我这是在什么地方？[l][cm]","charaName":"“浴缸”瑟尼"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_12"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]啊，看来你意识清醒了，感觉怎么样？[l][cm]","charaName":"药化系学生赫尔薇"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_13"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]你是谁？咦？你们不是米拉贝尔的朋友吗？怎么也会在这里？[l]","charaName":"“浴缸”瑟尼"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_14"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_15","text":"（解释当前的情况。）"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_15"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]原来如此……非常感谢你，赫尔薇小姐。但我现在必须启程了。我来霜烬平原的目的就是前往温泉村，我必须尽快赶到那里！[l][cm]","charaName":"“浴缸”瑟尼"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_16"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]温泉村？那儿和你倒下的地方完全是两个方向呀？[l][cm]","charaName":"药化系学生赫尔薇"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_17"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]温泉村离大书院还有一段距离，以你现在的身体状况恐怕难以承受，还是多休养几天再动身为好。[l][cm]","charaName":"药化系学生赫尔薇"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_18"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]说来惭愧，刚来到霜烬平原时，我的行李就被一群芙洛波偷走了。后来到了这附近，我的指南针和地图又被冰棱妖精抢走了……[l][cm]","charaName":"“浴缸”瑟尼"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_19"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]所以我只能像个无头苍蝇一样乱跑，最后才找到这个地方。给赫尔薇小姐添麻烦了，实在非常抱歉。[l][cm]","charaName":"“浴缸”瑟尼"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_20"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]但是我真的想要去温泉村，因为我听说那里也有很棒的——浴缸！[l][cm]","charaName":"“浴缸”瑟尼"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_21"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]浴缸？你费尽心思来到这里，就为了区区一个浴缸？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_22"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]什么叫区区浴缸？浴缸既是我给自己的名号，也是我心中的灵魂！[l][cm]","charaName":"“浴缸”瑟尼"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_23"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]在找遍魔爪湖的浴缸后，我依然无法满足。之后，我听说了温泉村的事！那里有这么多人喜欢泡澡，肯定有最好的浴缸！我来这里就是为了朝圣的！[l][cm]","charaName":"“浴缸”瑟尼"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_24"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]对了，几位不是契约者吗？不然这样，就请你们一路上保护我到温泉村，我会给你们报酬的！[l][cm]","charaName":"“浴缸”瑟尼"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_25"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这个……既然是旧识，跟你一起去看看也不是不行。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_26"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]那好，我们就出发吧！赫尔薇小姐，感谢你这段时间的照顾！这些钱就当作是给你的谢礼了。[l][cm]","charaName":"“浴缸”瑟尼"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_27"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]不必客气。作为学生能帮助远道而来的客人是我的荣幸。祝你们一路顺风！[l][cm]","charaName":"药化系学生赫尔薇"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_28"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]谢谢！那……我们出发吧，去温泉村找那边的话事人，希望他能把温泉村最好的浴缸出让给我！[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"“浴缸”瑟尼"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_29"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1b","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[hide]","charaName":""}},{"key":"end","para":{"end":true}}]}